  hearMoreName: TechnicalHearMore03
  hearMoreText: "Technical sustainability includes resource efficiency \u2014 using
    memory, bandwidth, and CPU wisely. Bloated or redundant code wastes not only
    energy but also developer time. Even small optimizations \u2014 like smarter
    caching or reducing unnecessary API calls \u2014 make systems leaner, faster,
    and more environmentally friendly."
